-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&lt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #e9ae2b; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">상상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #e9ae2b; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">현실</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">! </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #e9ae2b; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">아이디어</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">를 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #e9ae2b; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">특허</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">! 2017 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대학창의발명대회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&gt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대비 설명회 및 특